window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The gladiator ring only has one victor. Can the Taori warriors survive—and save the females enslaved with them?</b><br> <br> <b>2 full-length novels and the conclusion of the Sky Clan of the Taori adventures!</b><br> <br> SUBDUE (Book 4): When Kalesh Naz wakes from crashing in his escape pod, he's enraged to find himself locked in a dungeon. He's on a battle moon where he and other fierce aliens are forced to battle for their survival as entertainment for the cruel Xulonians. But how can he subdue his mating fever when the female assigned to attend to him in the victor’s suite is so mysterious and alluring?<br> <br> STORM (Book 5): All she knows about the Taori warrior who saves her during an escape attempt and the ensuing battle is that he’s huge and horned. When he drags her from the carnage and deeper onto the barren moon, she’s grateful for his protection—even if he does eye her like she’s the last drop of water in the desert. Can they evade the aliens hunting them and escape the deadly moon before the Taori leave the sector without them?<br> <br> This collection contains the final two books in Tana Stone's steamy sci-fi romance series. The books feature tough women fighting for survival, horned warriors with mating fever, action-packed battles, and steamy scenes on pleasure planets.</p>"; 
